(6328011, 937224, 96751, '<td valign="top">Wonderful find. I''m wondering if that''s natural light or a strobe, and if the latter, how you did this.</td>', 'Wonderful find. I''m wondering if that''s natural light or a strobe, and if the latter, how you did this.', '2011-02-23 01:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6328013, 937210, 96751, '<td valign="top">Love those booties.  Don''t think the old ones look quite dejected enough :-(</td>', 'Love those booties.  Don''t think the old ones look quite dejected enough :-(', '2011-02-23 01:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6328014, 937260, 96751, '<td valign="top">This IS sad.  Not getting the title.</td>', 'This IS sad.  Not getting the title.', '2011-02-23 01:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6328016, 936486, 96751, '<td valign="top">Wonderful find.  A bit centered for my taste.  I wish the shoes had been a bit more to the right, with a bit more space between them and the shoes.</td>', 'Wonderful find.  A bit centered for my taste.  I wish the shoes had been a bit more to the right, with a bit more space between them and the shoes.', '2011-02-23 01:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6328017, 936700, 96751, '<td valign="top">That is rather forlorn.</td>', 'That is rather forlorn.', '2011-02-23 01:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6328018, 936565, 96751, '<td valign="top">This feels like a Ben image.  The ocean, the perfect blur, the little girl shoes.  Wonderful sense of abandonment here.  Left behind and forgotten.</td>', 'This feels like a Ben image.  The ocean, the perfect blur, the little girl shoes.  Wonderful sense of abandonment here.  Left behind and forgotten.', '2011-02-23 01:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6328019, 936678, 96751, '<td valign="top">Adorable.  Powerrul lines.</td>', 'Adorable.  Powerrul lines.', '2011-02-23 01:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6328021, 936984, 96751, '<td valign="top">There is something very upbeat about this image.  Perhaps the sparkly lights, how clean the shoes are, how clean the floor is...  Although it doesn''t say "lonely" to me, it is a marvelous image.</td>', 'There is something very upbeat about this image.  Perhaps the sparkly lights, how clean the shoes are, how clean the floor is...  Although it doesn''t say "lonely" to me, it is a marvelous image.', '2011-02-23 01:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6328022, 936893, 96751, '<td valign="top">Lonely indeed.  Just wish it had a bit more contrast.</td>', 'Lonely indeed.  Just wish it had a bit more contrast.', '2011-02-23 01:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6328025, 936733, 96751, '<td valign="top">A strong image on its own, but I feel like the title is trying to make it something it is not.  Some people dismiss titles as unnecessary, or superfluous. I''m not one of them.  I believe a title is the finishing touch of the image, and it cannot make a picture be something it is not.  To me, shoes that were done with the red light district would have been on a busy, dirty street, not on an empty country road :-)</td>', 'A strong image on its own, but I feel like the title is trying to make it something it is not.  Some people dismiss titles as unnecessary, or superfluous. I''m not one of them.  I believe a title is the finishing touch of the image, and it cannot make a picture be something it is not.  To me, shoes that were done with the red light district would have been on a busy, dirty street, not on an empty country road :-)', '2011-02-23 01:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6328027, 936873, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nice take on the challenge.  Could have deepened the tonal range.</td>', 'Nice take on the challenge.  Could have deepened the tonal range.', '2011-02-23 01:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6328028, 936820, 96751, '<td valign="top">Love the combination of street photography, motion blur, and surrealism.</td>', 'Love the combination of street photography, motion blur, and surrealism.', '2011-02-23 01:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6328029, 937182, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very Poe.</td>', 'Very Poe.', '2011-02-23 01:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6328032, 937186, 96751, '<td valign="top">Shameless inclusion of adorable animal to increase AWWWW factor.</td>', 'Shameless inclusion of adorable animal to increase AWWWW factor.', '2011-02-23 01:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6328034, 937046, 96751, '<td valign="top">AWESOME!!!!!  Brilliant photo, with great pathos, movement, emotional content.  Love the patterns in the water and the ominous shadows.</td>', 'AWESOME!!!!!  Brilliant photo, with great pathos, movement, emotional content.  Love the patterns in the water and the ominous shadows.', '2011-02-23 01:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
