(6328758, 937205, 124815, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful story. I miss a focal point though (I tend to look more at the hat). The photo is a bit even but being a witness of the past it goes beyond the "lonely shoes" task. Top 10, or top 5.</td>', 'This is a beautiful story. I miss a focal point though (I tend to look more at the hat). The photo is a bit even but being a witness of the past it goes beyond the "lonely shoes" task. Top 10, or top 5.', '2011-02-23 11:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
