(6328770, 936510, 124815, '<td valign="top">Great idea and such sadness that it''s not staged! I would have cropped from the left almost 25% but that''s a personal preference. Top 10.</td>', 'Great idea and such sadness that it''s not staged! I would have cropped from the left almost 25% but that''s a personal preference. Top 10.', '2011-02-23 12:00:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6328781, 936493, 124815, '<td valign="top">I contemplated this idea myself for this challenge and made a picture that I did not submit (yours is better) - we''ll discuss more when you are out of anonymity. It''s one of the few times when the border makes sense and gives a feel of finality and determination. 8</td>', 'I contemplated this idea myself for this challenge and made a picture that I did not submit (yours is better) - we''ll discuss more when you are out of anonymity. It''s one of the few times when the border makes sense and gives a feel of finality and determination. 8', '2011-02-23 12:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
