(6331137, 936510, 116899, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea here, but I would have cropped the image in such a fashion as to remove the small shed on the left side of the frame.  The collection of shoes creates a nice line to the television, I would have emphasized that part of the photo.</td>', 'I really like the idea here, but I would have cropped the image in such a fashion as to remove the small shed on the left side of the frame.  The collection of shoes creates a nice line to the television, I would have emphasized that part of the photo.', '2011-02-24 15:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6331138, 937181, 116899, '<td valign="top">Great processing, but I am not so hot on the composition.  It needs to be more balanced.</td>', 'Great processing, but I am not so hot on the composition.  It needs to be more balanced.', '2011-02-24 15:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6331139, 937054, 116899, '<td valign="top">I think I get it, hanging up the skates maybe?  I would have like to see the portion of the photo where the skates are tied off.  It is also a bit distracting with the railing.  I would like to see this shot with the stakes tied to the lower railing, and then shot with the ice in the background from under the rail.</td>', 'I think I get it, hanging up the skates maybe?  I would have like to see the portion of the photo where the skates are tied off.  It is also a bit distracting with the railing.  I would like to see this shot with the stakes tied to the lower railing, and then shot with the ice in the background from under the rail.', '2011-02-24 15:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6331140, 936791, 116899, '<td valign="top">The lines of this photo draw your eye down the bridge and then back to the shoes.  It would have been a much stronger image if the shoes were placed further down the bridge.</td>', 'The lines of this photo draw your eye down the bridge and then back to the shoes.  It would have been a much stronger image if the shoes were placed further down the bridge.', '2011-02-24 15:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6331141, 936941, 116899, '<td valign="top">The composition is unbalanced and the item(s) of interest are pushed to close to the frame edges.  The processing is nice, but it cannot overcome the cropping.</td>', 'The composition is unbalanced and the item(s) of interest are pushed to close to the frame edges.  The processing is nice, but it cannot overcome the cropping.', '2011-02-24 15:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
