(6332959, 936801, 67723, '<td valign="top">this photo totally lacks much contrast... this leaves me bored and uninterested with it. I suggest possibly adding more contrast somehow next time, through in camera or post processing. Not sure. I like the concept and I think you are getting there but I''d like to see more "impact"! if you know what I mean? :)  Hope this helps... thanks!</td>', 'this photo totally lacks much contrast... this leaves me bored and uninterested with it. I suggest possibly adding more contrast somehow next time, through in camera or post processing. Not sure. I like the concept and I think you are getting there but I''d like to see more "impact"! if you know what I mean? :)  Hope this helps... thanks!', '2011-02-26 12:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
