(6338508, 937263, 117474, '<td valign="top">Heh heh heh heh. <br/>What''s great about this is there''s a lot going on. The bird is incidental, sorta, and adds to the shot as an afterthought (after looking at it for a while). The focus of my eye is mostly on the boot which keeps the shot very much about the boot.<br/> <br/>What a great idea, though. *pats back* :P</td>', 'Heh heh heh heh. What''s great about this is there''s a lot going on. The bird is incidental, sorta, and adds to the shot as an afterthought (after looking at it for a while). The focus of my eye is mostly on the boot which keeps the shot very much about the boot. What a great idea, though. *pats back* :P', '2011-03-02 06:42:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(6338518, 936701, 86218, '<td valign="top">As a straight forward shot this is great and cant fault this on lighting and sharpness. I gave it a 5 and have voted very harshly in general given the theme of this challenge and entries not showing much creativity to rise to the theme of the challenge. Other less technically correct shots I would vote higher and this was a tough challenge to start out with. Looking forward to see more entries from you and kicking some butt of you know who... And having said that, I would propably follow suit in the que...lol.</td>', 'As a straight forward shot this is great and cant fault this on lighting and sharpness. I gave it a 5 and have voted very harshly in general given the theme of this challenge and entries not showing much creativity to rise to the theme of the challenge. Other less technically correct shots I would vote higher and this was a tough challenge to start out with. Looking forward to see more entries from you and kicking some butt of you know who... And having said that, I would propably follow suit in the que...lol.', '2011-03-02 06:55:02.000000', NULL, 0),
