(6339426, 936979, 98339, '<td valign="top">this was definitely a favorite of mine...I had this pegged to score much higher...like first or second at the very least...</td>', 'this was definitely a favorite of mine...I had this pegged to score much higher...like first or second at the very least...', '2011-03-02 17:39:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(6339477, 936979, 60224, '<td valign="top">Cool shot. This was my fav of the challenge. Thought for sure it''d ribbon. What I really liked about it...no real setup...just a naturally occurring setting. Most of the shots in this challenge had to be set up somehow to be interesting (including mine). This is the MOST interesting with no real setup! Or, at least it appears to be a natural setting in a bowling alley.</td>', 'Cool shot. This was my fav of the challenge. Thought for sure it''d ribbon. What I really liked about it...no real setup...just a naturally occurring setting. Most of the shots in this challenge had to be set up somehow to be interesting (including mine). This is the MOST interesting with no real setup! Or, at least it appears to be a natural setting in a bowling alley.', '2011-03-02 18:35:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(6339505, 936926, 119747, '<td valign="top">What a great way to finish with you 1000d :-) great idea and execution</td>', 'What a great way to finish with you 1000d :-) great idea and execution', '2011-03-02 19:10:44.000000', NULL, 0),
