(6349017, 936568, 68947, '<td valign="top">I have never gotten what is so wrong with a "soft focus"???  Everywhere but, here *DPC*, soft focus is a very acceptable and wanted style.  There are photographers in here who love to blur and have soft focus yet, the DPC crowd love to point out a soft focus as though it were a crime. LOL  Nice shot.  Has meaning and almost a story behind it. :)</td>', 'I have never gotten what is so wrong with a "soft focus"???  Everywhere but, here *DPC*, soft focus is a very acceptable and wanted style.  There are photographers in here who love to blur and have soft focus yet, the DPC crowd love to point out a soft focus as though it were a crime. LOL  Nice shot.  Has meaning and almost a story behind it. :)', '2011-03-11 19:22:56.000000', NULL, 0),
